# eval/: only case files (expected text) and READMEs are kept. Photos stay local
# (RULES.md 5.4) whatever their extension or case (.JPG, .heic ...); drafts and
# results hold the OCR text of every photo read, which may be private labels.
eval/**
!eval/**/
!eval/**/*.case.json
!eval/**/README.md

